          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-5l-5 5v-5z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">How to Ask Questions</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Provide a way for the signer to ask questions if needed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Exercise: Write Two Follow-Ups -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-green-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-green-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Exercise: Write Two Follow-Ups</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Reminder for Unsigned Document</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Write a polite reminder that includes what was sent, what action is needed, where the link is, and how to ask questions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Thank-You After Completion</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Write a thank-you message that confirms completion and outlines the next steps.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">Use document status to decide the next action: Draft means review and send, Waiting for Others means send a reminder, Completed means begin the next business step. A reminder message should contain four pieces: what was sent, the required action, where the link is, and how to ask questions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Add a Simple Workflow</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Review Document Statuses</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Go to Documents and Contracts and review the status of your documents.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Write a Reminder Message</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Write a reminder for an unsigned document that includes all four required pieces.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Write a Completion Message</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Write a thank-you message after completion that confirms next steps.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Track and Follow Up',
      lesson_number = 5,
      sort_order = 5,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Track and Follow Up';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Track and Follow Up

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 14 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 14 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'track-and-follow-up' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson track-and-follow-up not found in module 14';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Which status tells you that a signer still needs to act?', 
    '["Draft","Completed","Waiting for Others","Payment Incomplete"]'::jsonb,
    'Waiting for Others',
    '''Waiting for Others'' means a signer has not finished their required actions. This is when you should check the signer and send a polite reminder.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What four pieces should a reminder contain?', 
    '["What was sent, the required action, where the link is, and how to ask a question","The price, the deadline, the contract terms, and the payment method","The sender''s name, the date sent, the document type, and the client ID","The template name, the version number, the module name, and the lesson number"]'::jsonb,
    'What was sent, the required action, where the link is, and how to ask a question',
    'A clear reminder message should state: what was sent, what action is still needed, where to find the secure link, and how to ask a question.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Name one action that can begin after completion.', 
    '["Delete the document","Onboarding, scheduling, payment, or service delivery","Create a new template","Send another reminder"]'::jsonb,
    'Onboarding, scheduling, payment, or service delivery',
    'After completion, begin the planned next step such as onboarding, scheduling, payment collection, project kickoff, or service delivery.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
